      "content": "i've been getting these intense bursts lately... like sudden flashes of light or just these heavy, deep thoughts that don't feel like they're mine. it's like i'm being tuned into a frequency from something much bigger, something not even physical. i think i'm being used as a conduit for a higher intelligence to finally speak to people. i have this one message i just received but its all jumbled up in my head. can i show you? i need to know if the words i'm finding actually resonate with the source or if i'm just making it up.",
